\p \v 24 \rb “Arise,|ק֣וּמוּ\rb* \rb set out,|סְּע֗וּ\rb* \rb and cross|וְעִבְרוּ֮\rb*\rb |אֶת־\rb* \rb the Arnon|אַרְנֹן֒\rb* \rb Valley.|נַ֣חַל\rb* \rb See,|רְאֵ֣ה\rb* \rb I have delivered|נָתַ֣תִּי\rb* \rb into your hand|בְ֠יָדְךָ\rb* \rb Sihon|סִיחֹ֨ן\rb* \rb the Amorite,|הָֽאֱמֹרִ֛י\rb*\rb |וְאֶת־\rb* \rb king|מֶֽלֶךְ־\rb* \rb of Heshbon,|חֶשְׁבּ֧וֹן\rb* \rb and his land.|אַרְצ֖וֹ\rb*\rb |אֶת־\rb* \rb Begin|הָחֵ֣ל\rb* \rb to take possession of it|רָ֑שׁ\rb* \rb and engage|וְהִתְגָּ֥ר\rb* \rb him|בּ֖וֹ\rb* \rb in battle.|מִלְחָמָֽה׃\rb* \v 25 \rb This very|הַזֶּ֗ה\rb* \rb day|הַיּ֣וֹם\rb* \rb I will begin|אָחֵל֙\rb* \rb to put|תֵּ֤ת\rb* \rb the dread|פַּחְדְּךָ֙\rb* \rb and fear|וְיִרְאָ֣תְךָ֔\rb* \rb of you|עַל־\rb* \rb upon all|כָּל־\rb*\rb |פְּנֵי֙\rb* \rb the nations|הָֽעַמִּ֔ים\rb* \rb under|תַּ֖חַת\rb* \rb heaven.|הַשָּׁמָ֑יִם\rb*\rb |אֲשֶׁ֤ר\rb* \rb They will hear|יִשְׁמְעוּן֙\rb* \rb the reports of you|שִׁמְעֲךָ֔\rb* \rb and tremble|וְרָגְז֥וּ\rb* \rb in anguish|וְחָל֖וּ\rb* \rb because of you.”|מִפָּנֶֽיךָ׃\rb*
