\c 23
\s1 Exclusion from the Congregation
\p \v 1 \rb No man|לֹֽא־\rb* \rb with crushed|פְצֽוּעַ־\rb*\rb |דַּכָּ֛א\rb* \rb or severed|וּכְר֥וּת\rb* \rb genitals|שָׁפְכָ֖ה\rb* \rb may enter|יָבֹ֧א\rb* \rb the assembly|בִּקְהַ֥ל\rb* \rb of the LORD.|יְהוָֽה׃ס\rb*
