\q2 \rb yet your clothes|שַׂלְמֹֽתֵיכֶם֙\rb* \rb and sandals|וְנַֽעַלְךָ֥\rb*\rb |לֹֽא־\rb*\rb |בָלְתָ֖ה\rb*\rb |מֵעַ֥ל\rb*\rb |מֵעֲלֵיכֶ֔ם\rb*\rb |רַגְלֶֽךָ׃\rb* \rb did not|לֹֽא־\rb* \rb wear out.|בָל֤וּ\rb*
\q1 \v 6 \rb You ate|אֲכַלְתֶּ֔ם\rb* \rb no|לֹ֣א\rb* \rb bread|לֶ֚חֶם\rb* \rb and drank|שְׁתִיתֶ֑ם\rb* \rb no wine|וְיַ֥יִן\rb* \rb or strong drink,|וְשֵׁכָ֖ר\rb*\rb |לֹ֣א\rb*
