\p \v 10 \rb All|כֻּלְּכֶ֔ם\rb* \rb of you|אַתֶּ֨ם\rb* \rb are standing|נִצָּבִ֤ים\rb* \rb today|הַיּוֹם֙\rb* \rb before|לִפְנֵ֖י\rb* \rb the LORD|יְהוָ֣ה\rb* \rb your God—|אֱלֹהֵיכֶ֑ם\rb* \rb you leaders|רָאשֵׁיכֶ֣ם\rb* \rb of tribes,|שִׁבְטֵיכֶ֗ם\rb*\f + \fr 29:10 \ft LXX and Syriac; Hebrew \fqa you leaders, tribes\f* \rb elders,|זִקְנֵיכֶם֙\rb* \rb officials,|וְשֹׁ֣טְרֵיכֶ֔ם\rb* \rb and all|כֹּ֖ל\rb* \rb the men|אִ֥ישׁ\rb* \rb of Israel,|יִשְׂרָאֵֽל׃\rb* \v 11 \rb your children|טַפְּכֶ֣ם\rb* \rb and wives,|נְשֵׁיכֶ֔ם\rb* \rb and the foreigners|וְגֵ֣רְךָ֔\rb*\rb |אֲשֶׁ֖ר\rb* \rb in|בְּקֶ֣רֶב\rb* \rb your camps|מַחֲנֶ֑יךָ\rb* \rb who cut|מֵחֹטֵ֣ב\rb* \rb your wood|עֵצֶ֔יךָ\rb*\rb |עַ֖ד\rb* \rb and draw|שֹׁאֵ֥ב\rb* \rb your water—|מֵימֶֽיךָ׃\rb* \v 12 \rb so that you may enter|לְעָבְרְךָ֗\rb* \rb into the covenant|בִּבְרִ֛ית\rb* \rb of the LORD|יְהוָ֥ה\rb* \rb your God,|אֱלֹהֶ֖יךָ\rb* \rb which|אֲשֶׁר֙\rb* \rb He|יְהוָ֣ה\rb*\rb |אֱלֹהֶ֔יךָ\rb* \rb is making|כֹּרֵ֥ת\rb* \rb with you today,|עִמְּךָ֖\rb*\rb |הַיּֽוֹם׃\rb* \rb and into His oath,|וּבְאָלָת֑וֹ\rb* \v 13 \rb and so that|לְמַ֣עַן\rb* \rb He may establish|הָקִֽים־\rb* \rb you|אֹתְךָ֩\rb* \rb today|הַיּ֨וֹם׀\rb* \rb as His|ל֜וֹ\rb* \rb people,|לְעָ֗ם\rb* \rb and He|וְה֤וּא\rb* \rb may be|יִֽהְיֶה־\rb* \rb your|לְּךָ֙\rb* \rb God|לֵֽאלֹהִ֔ים\rb* \rb as|כַּאֲשֶׁ֖ר\rb* \rb He promised|דִּבֶּר־\rb* \rb you|לָ֑ךְ\rb* \rb and as|וְכַאֲשֶׁ֤ר\rb* \rb He swore|נִשְׁבַּע֙\rb* \rb to your fathers,|לַאֲבֹתֶ֔יךָ\rb* \rb to Abraham,|לְאַבְרָהָ֥ם\rb* \rb Isaac,|לְיִצְחָ֖ק\rb* \rb and Jacob.|וּֽלְיַעֲקֹֽב׃\rb*
